 .com/events/login/1PeTHmohRHzRIhacThGKSkFjRJOUxmsbAMT7y\n\nDeal context:\n
 DBR Land Holdings LLC (NYSE: LB)\, the operating entity behind LandBridge\
 , is bringing a $100 million fungible add-on to its existing 6.250% Senior
  Notes due December 1\, 2030\, rated B1/BB-/BB (Moody's/S&P/Fitch)\, placi
 ng this firmly in high-yield territory. The deal is priced at an IPT of 99
 .01 (fungibility price) via 144A/Reg S for Life format\, with Truist actin
 g as left lead alongside seven joint bookrunners including Barclays\, Texa
 s Capital\, WFS\, Academy\, Huntington\, Citi\, and Goldman Sachs. Proceed
 s will be used to repay a portion of outstanding borrowings under the Revo
 lving Credit Facility\, with an investor call scheduled for 9/22 at 10:30 
 AM ET and pricing expected the same day.
